      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DOLLAR ROLEX (1) turned in a plain performance last time when seventh at Taree Super Track over 300m behind Extreme Blue (18.03) in a Grade 5. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from four attempts. Should bounce back. SEMI PEAKIN' (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (23.16) in a Grade 5 at Maitland. Has a good record here including five wins. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Cannot be taken lightly. FASCINATE MARIA (7) goes very well this trip starting 26 times for 11 wins and two minors. Was out of placings last time (23.74) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing sixth and beaten 12 lengths. Looks suited here and can measure up. MARVELLOUS DUNN (2) can feature with the right run.",
